{"ID":"20240118151121-oawlk7t","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151121-oawlk7t","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151121-oawlk7t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151121-6vpv1np\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122132330-17mz2ct\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122132324-k8df2cg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:29,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:29\u0026#125;","title":"204翘根","type":"doc","updated":"20240201134452"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151121-6vpv1np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151121-6vpv1np","updated":"20240122132323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘，寒，有小毒。治下热气，益阴精，令人面悦好，明目。久服轻身，耐老。生平泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132323-xw5kts5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132323-xw5kts5"}},{"ID":"20240122132324-k8df2cg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132324-k8df2cg","updated":"20240201134452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第204，翘根。现在也是很少人能够认得。我们后面有介绍连翘，我们就用连翘来讲它，这个地方我们原文保留在这边。"}]},{"ID":"20240122132330-17mz2ct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132330-17mz2ct"}}]}